WEBVTT

00:17:27.945 --> 00:17:30.602
In fact, even after the opportunity
to swap has expired,

00:17:30.626 --> 00:17:32.636
they still don't like their picture.

00:17:33.127 --> 00:17:34.278
Why?

00:17:34.302 --> 00:17:37.610
Because the [reversible] condition
is not conducive

00:17:37.634 --> 00:17:39.455
to the synthesis of happiness.

00:17:40.218 --> 00:17:43.121
So here's the final piece
of this experiment.

00:17:43.145 --> 00:17:46.885
We bring in a whole new group
of naive Harvard students

00:17:46.909 --> 00:17:50.265
and we say, "You know,
we're doing a photography course,

00:17:50.289 --> 00:17:52.040
and we can do it one of two ways.

00:17:52.607 --> 00:17:55.240
We could do it so that when
you take the two pictures,

00:17:55.264 --> 00:17:57.285
you'd have four days to change your mind,

00:17:57.309 --> 00:18:00.198
or we're doing another course
where you take the two pictures